{#- A thank-you, and a straight answer to the survey cards.

    EVERY RATING IS SHOWN, the lowest with the highest, each as the share
    who said Great or Good, the same sum /feedback does. The counts behind
    them, Okay and Poor included, are on that page, and the caption says so.

    "NOT FOR NOW" is the same answer /feedback gives (feedback.json), and
    STILL WORKING ON comes from the survey's most common "do better" themes.
    A customer's words never go here: this batch of cards has no OK to share.

    Every size is set for the ~540px a portrait post shows at on a phone:
    nothing a customer needs is under 24px. -#}
{%- set o = site.opening %}
<div class="canvas fm">

    <header class="fm-head">
        <div class="wordmark wordmark--light wordmark--hero fm-wordmark">
            {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
        </div>
        <p class="p-display-italic fm-kicker">Our First Month</p>
        <p class="p-label fm-range">Open since {{ o.monthDay }} &middot; {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fm-body">
        <h1 class="p-display fm-title">Thank you, {{ site.address.locality }}</h1>
        <p class="p-body fm-lede">You filled out {{ feedbackStats.total }} survey cards, and we read every one.</p>

        <p class="p-label fm-label">Rated Great or Good</p>
        <ul class="fm-stats" role="list">
            {%- for r in ratingShares %}
            <li class="fm-stat">
                <span class="p-display fm-num">{{ r.share }}%</span>
                <span class="p-body fm-stat-name">{{ r.label }}</span>
            </li>
            {%- endfor %}
        </ul>

        <p class="p-label fm-label">What you asked for</p>
        <ul class="fm-asked" role="list">
            {%- for a in asked %}
            <li class="fm-row">
                <span class="p-display fm-ask">{{ a.ask }}</span>
                <span class="p-body fm-reply">{{ a.reply }}</span>
            </li>
            {%- endfor %}
        </ul>

        <section class="fm-working">
            <p class="p-display fm-working-title">Still working on</p>
            <ul class="fm-working-list" role="list">
                {%- for w in working %}
                <li>{{ w }}</li>
                {%- endfor %}
            </ul>
        </section>

        <p class="p-body fm-more">Keep telling us: cards at the counter, or {{ site.social.website }}/survey</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="fm-foot">
        <p class="p-display fm-foot-call">{{ site.phone }} <span class="dot">&middot;</span> {{ site.social.website }}</p>
        <p class="p-body fm-foot-line">{{ o.hoursDays }}, {{ o.opens.time | replace(":00", "") }}{{ o.opens.meridiem }} &ndash; {{ o.closes.time | replace(":00", "") }}{{ o.closes.meridiem }} &middot; {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.locality }}, {{ site.address.region }}</p>
    </footer>

</div>
